### in_range bounds guard

#### accepts a zero-size range at offset zero

- Verify: accepts a zero-size range at offset zero
   - Expected: in_range(data, 0i64, 0i64) is true


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: accepts a zero-size range at offset zero")
var data: [u8] = []
data.push(0u8)
expect(in_range(data, 0i64, 0i64)).to_equal(true)
```

</details>

